{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>一名28歲女子在黃大仙一間銀行，行使懷疑假鈔被捕。</p><p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.BANKNOTE-1830.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026KEws8yikqT1795433641.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><br/></p><p>現場是大有街渣打銀行，警方帶走涉案女子調查，她持有香港身份證。</p><p></p><p>警方下午3時接獲銀行職員報案，一名28歲女子有意存入70張美元現鈔，面值分別是100元和50元，懷疑是假鈔，警方到場將她拘捕。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T11:43:51.857239+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T10:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T11:47:02.810865+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T11:37:13.051933+00:00","content_hash":"e17c42905c6206f441fda4ea231ca3dbfd1193505900a05e3efce2614d825db6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T11:43:51.857239+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}